msgstr "Wizard permintaan lowongan yang memiliki baris ini."

#. module: ssi_hr_manpower_planning_recruitment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_hr_manpower_planning_recruitment.field_create_recruitment_vacancy_from_manpower_planning_line__job_id
