msgstr "Jabatan yang diminta pada lowongan."

#. module: ssi_hr_manpower_planning_recruitment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_hr_manpower_planning_recruitment.field_create_recruitment_vacancy_from_manpower_planning_line__quantity
msgid "Number of new employees to recruit. It must be at least 1."
msgstr "Jumlah karyawan baru yang direkrut. Minimal 1."

#. module: ssi_hr_manpower_planning_recruitment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_hr_manpower_planning_recruitment.field_create_recruitment_vacancy_from_manpower_planning_line__expected_join_date
msgid ""
"Date on which the new employees are expected to join. It must be on or "
"after the start date of the wizard."
msgstr ""
"Tanggal karyawan baru diharapkan mulai bergabung. Harus pada atau setelah "
"tanggal mulai wizard."

#. module: ssi_hr_manpower_planning_recruitment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_hr_manpower_planning_recruitment.field_create_recruitment_vacancy_from_manpower_planning_line__reason
msgid "Reason why this vacancy is needed."
msgstr "Alasan lowongan ini dibutuhkan."

#. module: ssi_hr_manpower_planning_recruitment
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_hr_manpower_planning_recruitment.field_recruitment_vacancy__manpower_planning_id
msgid ""
"Manpower planning this vacancy was requested from. Optional and filled "
"when the vacancy is created from a manpower planning."
msgstr ""
"Perencanaan tenaga kerja asal permintaan lowongan ini. Opsional dan terisi"
" saat lowongan dibuat dari perencanaan tenaga kerja."

